WEBVTT

NOTE Unofficial English translation of the Thai narration. If it differs from the Thai original documents, the Thai original prevails.

00:00:01.100 --> 00:00:06.470
The Subcommittee on Holistic Security,
under the Senate Committee on

00:00:06.470 --> 00:00:11.840
Military Affairs and State Security,
has called Meeting No. 22/2569.

00:00:11.920 --> 00:00:17.420
Wednesday, 25 November 2026,
at 9.00 a.m.

00:00:17.500 --> 00:00:22.900
Committee meeting room CA 327,
3rd floor, Parliament House.

00:00:23.900 --> 00:00:28.214
The subcommittee chair is
Mr. Thanatpong Wongmulalee.

00:00:28.294 --> 00:00:32.684
This subcommittee is part of the
Senate Committee on Military

00:00:32.684 --> 00:00:36.859
Affairs and State Security,
chaired by Mr. Somboon Nunual.

00:00:37.860 --> 00:00:41.400
According to the meeting notice,
the agenda has four items.

00:00:41.480 --> 00:00:44.805
Item 1: announcements by the chair.

00:00:44.885 --> 00:00:48.580
Item 2: adoption of the minutes
of Meeting No. 21/2569.

00:00:48.660 --> 00:00:51.843
Item 3: one matter for consideration.

00:00:51.923 --> 00:00:56.120
And Item 4: other matters
and the next meeting date.

00:00:57.120 --> 00:01:00.400
The matter this time
was also in the notices

00:01:00.400 --> 00:01:03.159
for Meetings No. 20/2569 and 21/2569.

00:01:03.240 --> 00:01:06.883
Meeting No. 20/2569 invited
the commanders of the

00:01:06.883 --> 00:01:10.079
Surasakmontri Force and
the Suranari Force.

00:01:10.160 --> 00:01:13.230
Meeting No. 21/2569
invited the commanders of

00:01:13.230 --> 00:01:16.164
the Pha Muang Force and
the Naresuan Force.

00:01:16.245 --> 00:01:19.928
And the summary of Meeting
No. 20/2569 says the meeting

00:01:19.928 --> 00:01:23.879
agreed in principle to plan
visits to the border protection

00:01:23.879 --> 00:01:26.959
forces, region by region,
throughout the year.

00:01:27.960 --> 00:01:32.237
This time, the matter for
consideration is boundary problems

00:01:32.237 --> 00:01:35.801
and ways to solve them,
and the security situation

00:01:35.801 --> 00:01:39.579
along Thailand's borders
with neighbouring countries.

00:01:39.660 --> 00:01:43.208
The subcommittee has invited
the commanders of the Thep

00:01:43.208 --> 00:01:46.756
Satri Force and the Chanthaburi
and Trat Border Defence

00:01:46.756 --> 00:01:49.659
Command, or their
representatives, to attend.

00:01:50.660 --> 00:01:54.820
This information comes from the
subcommittee's meeting notice.

00:01:54.900 --> 00:01:57.100
The schedule may change.

00:01:57.180 --> 00:01:59.652
Meeting results will be
available through the

00:01:59.652 --> 00:02:01.959
channels of the
Secretariat of the Senate.

